Hello NetHack and variant players!
This is an announcement of the NetHack Summer Tournament this year!
This is the first of the (hopefully) annual summer tournament series. 
This tournament is not limited to NetHack, it also includes servers from 
several variants including AceHack, UnNetHack, SporkHack and as a special 
challenge to dedicated players NetHack 1.3d. 
This tournament is intended not to replace /dev/null but to provide an 
additional challenge to NetHack and variant players without having to 
wait for one tournament a year; we feel there is room for two tournaments 
a year. As well, this tournament is multi-variant and offers a tournament 
experience to a wider selection of players.
This tournament starts at 12:00 AM UTC on Sunday July 17th and runs until 
the end of August 14th UTC. We apologize for the short notice this year, 
and we plan to provide more advance notice next year. The tournament date 
this year is slightly closer to /dev/null than we would like, and we wish 
the timing could have been slightly earlier; this may be reflected in a 
scheduling change for next year. Suggestions for scheduling as well as 
feedback is always welcome. :)
You can register, view scores and trophies as well as the list of 
available servers at http://junethack.rawrnix.com/. For questions you can 
reply here or contact us in #junethack on Freenode.
Good luck!


